import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="常见问题" titleEn="FAQ"><div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="常见问题">FAQ</div><h1 data-zh="你可能想知道这些。">What you may want to know.</h1><p class="lead" data-site-text="faq" style="white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></p></div><section data-site-faq-default class="container legal" style="padding-top:0"><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="免费额度何时领取？">When do I receive free credits?</h3><p data-zh="注册并验证邮箱后，首次连接符合资格的 Chrome 插件安装实例即可领取一次 200 次免费额度。每个安装实例仅可领取一次，不按天或月重置，也不主动过期。">After verifying your email, link an eligible Chrome extension installation to receive 200 welcome credits. Each installation can claim once; credits do not reset or expire.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="一次生成三种风格扣几次？">How many credits do three styles use?</h3><p data-zh="一次请求生成自然、幽默、观点三种候选，只扣一次。切换、复制或填入草稿不会再扣。">One request returns natural, playful, and thoughtful drafts and uses one credit. Switching, copying, or filling a draft costs no extra credits.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="需要自己的 AI API Key 吗？">Do I need my own AI API key?</h3><p data-zh="不需要。AI 由 x-Reply-Helper 云端服务提供。">No. x-Reply-Helper provides the hosted AI service.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="会自动发送 X 回复吗？">Will it post on X?</h3><p data-zh="不会。你检查草稿后决定是否点击发送。">No. You review the draft and decide whether to send it.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="如何充值？">How do I top up?</h3><p data-zh="请在价格页查看当前套餐和支付方式。支付确认后，额度会计入账户。">Visit pricing for current packages and payment options. Credits are added after payment is confirmed.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 data-zh="在哪里反馈问题？">How can I send feedback?</h3><p><a href="/feedback" data-zh="使用反馈表单。">Use the feedback form.</a></p></div></section></Base>
